# LF in every checkout, Windows included.
#
# The templates Anchors embeds (`go:embed`) and the fixtures its tests compare byte for byte
# are text: a CRLF checkout — Git for Windows' default — changed what a Windows build
# embeds and what the tests read, and they failed there only. The released binaries are
# built on Linux; this keeps a build or a test run on Windows the same.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary fixtures stay as they are.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
